ine between life and death is blurred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story of Betrayal and Power:</strong> Immerse yourself in a complex narrative filled with conspiracies, betrayals, and sacrifices. Discover how the greed for controlling TOX-Z drove humanity to the brink of extinction and decide the world's fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544590/extras/2b31331422a5c88754e59bd4581399d8.avif?t=1746098055\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544590/extras_big/2b31331422a5c88754e59bd4581399d8.avif?t=1746098055 width=800 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Copycor Dev Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544590/header.jpg?t=1746098055","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544590/831440/916c9ed9f5c2dd8e4568caca4a82ed618383b3a4/1750859470/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740179444","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544590/831440/916c9ed9f5c2dd8e4568caca4a82ed618383b3a4/1750859470/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740179444","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3544590/831440/916c9ed9f5c2dd8e4568caca4a82ed618383b3a4/1750859470/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740179444","id":257099852,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257099852/movie480.mp4?t=1740179444","ma